                                "text": "https:\/\/bugs.r-project.org\/attachment.cgi?id=3798&action=edit"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "\nFix Rd_macros_package_dir() to read from processRdChunk_data_store()\n\nIncluding a [tested]("
